{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"demo/local.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:44:32.467902Z","id":"adc9c87f516e572fe5cc58c4926b6d621944048c21899d66b840fa04294b14ab","body":{"detail":"The worker target rejects at start. Wiring it needs crates/clax-worker under wrangler dev --local with the setup secret, public origin and live seats as vars, the UI served, and the hosted sign-in routes on the Durable Object; its MCP path (/mcp) is already the target's mcpPath.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":86},"end":{"line":97},"content_hash":"a42b5a3ee030bf2c89816eee14425c19ff6117591ad812716664676168aed411"},"summary":"--worker is a stub: the demo runs only on the native daemon","tags":["demo","worker","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"demo/local.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T07:44:32.467928Z","id":"981958486e4cc33fd4ecdacb803ed16e6c7e245ff4118e8fb3f5dcfa50eb9435","body":{"detail":"On the Rust shell an agent's new version is offered as Reload in the top bar rather than swapped in (web/shell/src/view/artifact-stream.ts follows only by_page versions); agent chips read '<harness> <handle>' rather than the session's name (summary-writer); there is no draft tool, so shot 4 has no live drafts (demo/lib/agents.ts skips them); and core has no forks, so shot 9 and the seeded fork are missing. The video script needs a pass for the Rust stack before recording.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":206},"end":{"line":216},"content_hash":"e28a65352a7d403e51bc69f0c400c4ebeac5d6d7174e0704e3fd3ffd877e6559"},"summary":"The demo shows behaviours that differ from docs/hosted/video-script.md shots 2 to 9","tags":["demo","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"demo/local.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T09:19:33.549171Z","id":"046440134f7696c38abd5eb9a8e8b3dc5d33483db7f3a40b6699791fd19067f0","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:fbc2d533","summary":"Agent chips now read the session's agent name (git:bab70d8a: AgentView and WorkingView carry `name`; web/e2e/hosted-demo.spec.ts asserts the top bar reads summary-writer and no 'claude'; 3 runs passed), and the remaining differences (Reload, no drafts, no forks, no git, approvals in People and the inbox, presence without pointers) are listed under 'Rust stack differences' at the top of docs/hosted/video-script.md; the rewrite of the shots is tracked on that file.","supersedes":"981958486e4cc33fd4ecdacb803ed16e6c7e245ff4118e8fb3f5dcfa50eb9435","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"demo/local.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T11:49:03.364716Z","id":"44ff7cc054fa9e6c9cbc635c490cc314e4d0bedcf6fc28e8e6095620c525254d","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:5910e23b","summary":"--worker is wired and the default: `just hosted-demo` built the web UI and the Worker, started wrangler dev --local on :60591, seeded it, printed the links and clone commands, ran the agents over /mcp on Enter (4 versions, 2 conflicts merged), a git clone of the brief showed Clax-Publisher and Clax-Agent per commit, and Ctrl-C left nothing on the port (lsof -iTCP:60591 exit 1)","supersedes":"adc9c87f516e572fe5cc58c4926b6d621944048c21899d66b840fa04294b14ab","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"demo/local.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-13T11:49:03.382483Z","id":"5dcbc66271231c558fa9c7517263df8e222d251951b379c3fd4ad7899eb3d3e2","body":{"detail":"worker.extra mints the brief's read token with POST /_dev/repos/token (demo/lib/worker.ts repoToken), which crates/clax-worker/src/repos/worker.rs dev_route serves to anyone while REPO_DEV_ROUTES=1, so demo/lib/worker.ts demoVars turns that var on for every demo Worker. The token is the owner's (no holder), so the clone it gives shows no per-person filtering. The server's POST /api/artifacts/{id}/git-token route (signed-in person, rights-checked) is not on this branch; once it is, mint the token as Rae through it (s.owner.session) and drop REPO_DEV_ROUTES from demoVars, in web/e2e/hosted-demo-worker.spec.ts too.","kind":"concern","span":{"start":{"line":123},"end":{"line":136},"content_hash":"641780c807ccf81cb2095664769aec754054cd11256fa515b6305c4a0de81370"},"summary":"The demo's git clone token comes from the stand-in's unauthenticated dev route, not a person's git token","tags":["demo","worker","git","status:deferred","revisit:POST /api/artifacts/{id}/git-token is served by the Worker","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"demo/local.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-14T03:18:07.372791Z","id":"9bddbac1ec931d1f3e27a68f077f4037cbc2cf98f60c3fe9929a54c353f30cd6","body":{"kind":"comment","references":"5dcbc66271231c558fa9c7517263df8e222d251951b379c3fd4ad7899eb3d3e2","summary":"The revisit condition holds: the Worker serves POST /api/artifacts/{id}/git-token (crates/clax-server/src/routes/git_token.rs, merged with the git remotes). While REPO_DEV_ROUTES=1 the dev route also mints write tokens for any artifact and any holder and writes versions unauthenticated, to anyone who reaches the demo's port (127.0.0.1 only).","tags":["session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
{"metabox":"1","type":"annotation","subject":"demo/local.ts","issuer":"mailto:alex@kesling.co","issuer_type":"ai","created_at":"2026-10-14T04:46:48.107082Z","id":"afe3a46d57521afb6ffd696d402e76ea4d34dff10fa9cd4866a5627b3a5c09c7","body":{"kind":"resolve","ref":"git:387d2b4e","summary":"The demo takes its git tokens from people's git-token route (demo/lib/worker.ts gitToken, as Rae) and the demo Worker runs without REPO_DEV_ROUTES; the demo spec clones with the command Rae's Clone dialog shows, and docs/hosted/video-script.md shot 8 takes read and write tokens from the Clone dialog. Evidence: CLAX_E2E_WORKER=1 npx playwright test hosted-demo-worker in web/: 1 passed, three runs in a row.","supersedes":"5dcbc66271231c558fa9c7517263df8e222d251951b379c3fd4ad7899eb3d3e2","tags":["reason:fixed","session:claude-code:6847a238-376f-486d-8e40-4d0fa676e347"]}}
